{"words": [{"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "Those "}, {"text": "هُمُ", "translation": "they are"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "the believers"}, {"text": "حَقًّۭا ۚ", "translation": "(in) truth"}, {"text": "لَّهُمْ", "translation": "For them"}, {"text": "دَرَجَـٰتٌ", "translation": "(are) ranks"}, {"text": "عِندَ", "translation": "with"}, {"text": "رَبِّهِمْ", "translation": "their Lord"}, {"text": "وَمَغْفِرَةٌۭ", "translation": "and forgiveness"}, {"text": "وَرِزْقٌۭ", "translation": "and a provision"}, {"text": "كَرِيمٌۭ", "translation": "noble"}], "sahih": "Those are the believers, truly. For them are degrees [of high position] with their Lord and forgiveness and noble provision."}